  <attributes>
    <name>List</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <valueType>
      <types>DynamicList</types>
    </valueType>
    <view>
      <common>true</common>
    </view>
    <edit>
      <common>true</common>
    </edit>
    <main>true</main>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:DynamicListExtInfo">
      <queryText>SELECT
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Register AS Register,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption AS AccessOption,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Field1 AS Field1,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Field2 AS Field2,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Field3 AS Field3,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Field4 AS Field4,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.Field5 AS Field5,
	AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessKey AS AccessKey,
	CASE
		WHEN AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption = 0
			THEN FALSE
		ELSE AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption - (CAST(AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 2 - 0.5 AS NUMBER(15, 0))) * 2 = 1
	END AS ForExternalUsers,
	CASE
		WHEN AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption = 0
			THEN 0
		WHEN AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 64 >= 1
			THEN (CAST(AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 2 - 0.5 AS NUMBER(15, 0))) - (CAST(AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 64 - 0.5 AS NUMBER(15, 0))) * 32
		ELSE CAST(AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 2 - 0.5 AS NUMBER(15, 0))
	END AS FieldsInJoinCount,
	CASE
		WHEN AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 64 >= 1
			THEN CAST(AccessKeysForRegisters.AccessOption / 64 - 0.5 AS NUMBER(15, 0))
		ELSE 0
	END AS FieldsSetInJoin
FROM
	InformationRegister.AccessKeysForRegisters AS AccessKeysForRegisters</queryText>
      <mainTable>InformationRegister.AccessKeysForRegisters</mainTable>
      <autoFillAvailableFields>true</autoFillAvailableFields>
      <customQuery>true</customQuery>
      <autoSaveUserSettings>true</autoSaveUserSettings>
      <getInvisibleFieldPresentations>true</getInvisibleFieldPresentations>
    </extInfo>
  </attributes>
  <formCommands>
    <name>EnableEditing</name>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Allow editing</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اجازه ویرایش</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Abilitare possibilità di modifica</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Włącz możliwość edycji</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Включить возможность редактирования</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Düzenlemeye izin ver</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Bật tính năng chỉnh sửa</value>
    </title>
    <id>1</id>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Allow editing for troubleshooting. Recommended for advanced users only.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اجازه ویرایش برای عیب‌یابی. فقط برای کاربران پیشرفته توصیه می‌شود.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Abilitare possibilità di modifica solo allo scopo di ricerca dei malfunzionamenti (è necessaria la conoscenza approfondita del funzionamento del meccanismo)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Włącz możliwość edycji tylko dla celów wyszukiwania niesprawności (wymagane jest pogłębione zrozumienie mechanizmu pracy)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Включить возможность редактирования только для целей поиска неисправности (требуется углубленное понимание работы механизма)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Hata giderme için düzenlemeye izin ver. Bu özellik sadece ileri seviye kullanıcılara yöneliktir.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Bật tính năng chỉnh sửa chỉ nhằm tìm kiếm sự sai sót (cần hiểu sâu cách làm việc của cơ chế)</value>
    </toolTip>
    <use>
      <common>true</common>
    </use>
    <action xsi:type="form:FormCommandHandlerContainer">
      <handler>
        <name>EnableEditing</name>
      </handler>
    </action>
    <currentRowUse>DontUse</currentRowUse>
  </formCommands>
